<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85512" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολύ̆φορ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		(parox.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bearing much,
				productive, prolific,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. καὶ παμφόρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					705b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				6.3.9
			</span></i>: 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτεροι, φοινικῶνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					4.8.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρόνος π. πονηρίας</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.8.1
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κακὸν -ώτατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.361
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>that will bear much water,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλιγοφόρος,</span> of strong wine, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.669
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				7.23
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυφόρῳ δαίμονι
				δυγκεκρᾶσθαι</span> to have a fortune <i>that wants
				tempering,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				853
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
